{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A speaker talked for sixty minutes to a full auditorium. Twenty percent of the audience heard the entire talk and ten percent slept through the entire talk. Half of the remainder heard one third of the talk and the other half heard two thirds of the talk. What was the average number of minutes of the talk heard by members of the audience?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce869fa9c46ad3878e169cb34628e09e9e792d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 24 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 27\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }30 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }33 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people in the audience.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people heard <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes of the talk, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a9758ec9dc9794414f98cbcf31027ae963b715fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot 60 = 1200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" /> minutes heard.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people heard <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef6b8809eae480f14ea8d6b1c79ff189f04724da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{70}{2} = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" /> people heard <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes of the talk, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/5/f3567ce85aa49ff8d9f274faac734f2c9d624937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35\\cdot 20 = 700$\" width=\"100\" height=\"12\" /> minutes.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people heard <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes of the talk, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d751cd0b479bceb949355d9a385b9b0fcddaa3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1400$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>Altogether, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abeb596d01ca9a2d1d6f160129f09f5ccdc35542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1200 + 0 + 700 + 1400 = 3300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"238\" height=\"15\" /> minutes heard among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people.\n</p><p>Thus, the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717720cd0cafdf43afcacd62366e0d72a6a71425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3300}{100} = 33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" /> minutes, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b